{
  "name": "dsh-feishu-assistant",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "把飞书机器人接到 DSH 会话：长连接收私聊消息与卡片回调，注入指定会话、把回答回写飞书，不需要公网入口。四个特点：配对码把发送者绑成管理员，机器人只服务指定账号；非管理员请求走审批卡片，同意/拒绝都校验点击人身份；请求串行排队，前一条整轮 turn 跑完才注入下一条；目标会话启动时主动 resume，不用先有人在界面上点开。",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.2",
    "@larksuiteoapi/node-sdk": "^1.74.0",
    "lru-cache": "^11.5.3"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.5-rc.1 <0.2.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "feishu",
    "lark"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
